body_text = ">>73144291\ntwo regulars from the old NN threads stopped posting after going back in last month. one of them is actually missing, not internet-missing. family report and everything.\n\nprobably unrelated. still wouldn't put that apk on my main handtop."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Post_9"]
